  "body": "**Blocked by:** #196\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #196; #198 is the next sequential slice of the `mail-live-sync` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nRegister users.watch, persist history/expiry, renew daily before seven days. Consume pull messages, validate account, acknowledge after durable handoff, advance with history.list. Deduplicate/out-of-order; expired history triggers full reconcile/new cursor.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- External GCP resource provisioning documented, not automated.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Renewal persists/survives restart.\n- Notification triggers history reconcile.\n- Duplicates cannot regress/duplicate.\n- Expired history recovers.\n",
